From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 17:13:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Link the bot to the website

- Main menu gets a Website button and a /site command (only when SITE_URL is set).
- After publishing, a 'View on the website' button opens the new listing
  directly (SITE_URL/?listing=<id>); each entry in My listings gets the same.
- /help names the project SilkRoad Exchange and links the site.
- SITE_URL must be https (Telegram URL buttons need it); a trailing slash is dropped.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AsQJVsZAe25vUgXiPC22gg
